OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh Green Party leader describes
OL,4,Aintense cancer treatment during
OL,5,Aelection
OL,6,
OL,7,FWales Green Party leader Anthony
OL,8,FSlaughter says he underwent intense
OL,9,Fcancer treatment while campaigning for
OL,10,FMay's Senedd election.
OL,12,FSlaughter, who will be stepping away
OL,13,Ffrom the role of leader at the end of
OL,14,Fthe year, described having "some
OL,15,Fintense bouts of treatment in the first
OL,16,Fhalf of 2025" after being diagnosed in
OL,17,FJanuary.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
