OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh Green Party leader describes
OL,4,Aintense cancer treatment during
OL,5,Aelection
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Member of the Senedd (MS) for
OL,8,FCaerdydd Penarth publicly revealed he
OL,9,Fhad been diagnosed with cancer in
OL,10,FSeptember, telling a Senedd debate of a
OL,11,F"scheduled and serious operation" he
OL,12,Fhad over the summer recess.
OL,14,FSlaughter also told the BBC's Walescast
OL,15,Fthat he would not have voted for the
OL,16,F"Zionism is racism" motion passed at
OL,17,Fhis party's conference last month.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
